t-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">에는 신청 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 허용 기간 : 수강신청기간 내 교무처로 제출자에 한함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; [</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 11. 24.(화) 11:00 ~ 11. 25.(수) 16:00</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2일간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 신청 절차 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 수강신청서 양식[</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">첨부파일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">] 작성 → 담당교수 서명 → 교무처(본관 201호) 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 담당교수연구실 확인 :</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> [원스톱서비스 - 학사관리 - 수강신청 - 개설강좌조회 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - ‘겨울계절학기’ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">선택 조회 - </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">강의계획서]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 제출처 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교무처 학사관리팀(본관201호)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 수강학점 : 6학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">★</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">계절수업 수강 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">환불 신청(취소)는 다음에 해당하는 경우만 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bol